# Rebuild and reinstall after changes

When extension/editor code in this repo is changed (host, webview, export, etc.), **do not ask** whether to reinstall. Directly:

1. `npm run build`
2. `npm run package`
3. `code --install-extension <generated-vsix> --force`

Use the VS Code `code` CLI. `--force` overwrites the already installed EasyView_Md. After install, tell the user to reload the VS Code window (or close and reopen the Markdown file) so the new bundle loads.

Do this at the end of the task, after the code changes are complete. Skip only for pure Q&A or docs-only edits that do not affect the installed extension.
